# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""T1 MINI Keyboard configuration tool (Linux / Windows / macOS).

Native re-implementation of the Windows "MINI KeyBoard.exe" (HIDTester)
configuration utility. Protocol reverse-engineered from the decompiled
original: VID=0x1189 PID=0x8890, config interface mi_01 (interface 1,
interrupt-OUT endpoint 0x02, no kernel driver bound).

Device write path per platform:
  Linux    usbfs (SUBMITURB) with a control-transfer fallback
  Windows  HID WriteFile on the mi_01 device
  macOS    IOHIDDeviceSetReport on the mi_01 service

Input events are read through the platform input backend and normalised to
Linux evdev codes, so settings files stay portable between the three OSes.
Run "t1-keyboard-config --selftest" to validate the install.
"""

